/* Simplified Chinese strings of the Windows room-correction page. Keys are the English source strings. */

"Fits the ADI-2's own parametric EQ: five bands per channel (bands 4 and 5 from 200 Hz), 0.5 dB steps. The DAC then corrects every source, not only this PC." = "按 ADI-2 自带的参数 EQ 来拟合：每声道 5 段（第 4、5 段从 200 Hz 起），步进 0.5 dB。之后由解码器校正所有音源，不只是这台电脑。";
"Tapline corrects what this PC plays, on the current output." = "由 Tapline 在当前输出上校正这台电脑播放的声音。";
"Turn on “Let desktop apps access your microphone” in Settings › Privacy & security › Microphone, then try again." = "请在“设置 › 隐私和安全性 › 麦克风”中打开“允许桌面应用访问你的麦克风”，然后重试。";
"The microphone sent only silence. Check that it is connected and not muted, and that Windows lets desktop apps use it (Settings › Privacy & security › Microphone)." = "麦克风传回的只有静音。请检查麦克风是否已连接、是否被静音，以及 Windows 是否允许桌面应用使用麦克风（设置 › 隐私和安全性 › 麦克风）。";
"Open Microphone Settings" = "打开麦克风设置";
/* Also used by the Assistant page; repeated so this file stands on its own. */
"RME ADI-2 EQ preset" = "RME ADI-2 EQ 预设";
"All files" = "所有文件";

/* Multichannel speakers (5.1 … 7.1.4). The speakers' names and the Room page's other strings come from the macOS file. */
"The output's channels changed. Check its speaker setup in Windows' Sound settings, then try again." = "输出的声道变了。请在 Windows 的声音设置中检查扬声器配置，然后重试。";
"Windows renders surround sound to the speakers set for this output in the Sound control panel (your output › Configure); Tapline reads the same layout. A Dolby or DTS bitstream passed through to a receiver cannot be processed." = "Windows 会按“声音”控制面板里为这个输出设定的扬声器（你的输出 › 配置）渲染环绕声；Tapline 读取的也是这个布局。直通给功放的杜比或 DTS 码流无法处理。";
"Not from its place: %@. Check the speaker cables, the receiver's speaker setup and the speakers set for this output in Windows' Sound control panel, then check again." = "位置不对：%@。请检查音箱线、功放的音箱设置以及 Windows“声音”控制面板里为这个输出设定的扬声器，然后再检查一次。";
